# The build checks the array layout at each instance the proofs use (the
# `const` assertions after `Arena`'s, `Arenas`'s, `Shared`'s and
# `Tcaches`'s layouts).
axiom_array_layout	core library	Kani	trusted (partly checked, const assert: `axiom_array_layout` at `Arena::split`'s instance in src/arena.rs, `axiom_array_layout` at `Arenas::split`'s two instances in src/arena.rs, `arena::axiom_array_layout` at `split`'s two instances in src/heap/shared.rs, `arena::axiom_array_layout` at `Tcaches::split`'s instance in src/heap/tcaches.rs, and Kani: arena::kani_array_layout::array_layout_samples; not checked: the axiom is generic in `T` and `N`, and these check only the six instances the proofs use and the sampled ones)	contract 2931506158, body none
