# Joining typed field permissions into the struct's: no vstd counterpart.
axiom_arena_assemble	raw pointer (internal)	none (assumption)
# A raw in-place fill, like `stats::zero_records`: zero bytes are a free
# lock over an empty record, then the `index` store. The harness runs
# the body on a slot of arbitrary bytes; the rank is a ghost field.
Arena::put_stats	raw pointer (internal)	Kani	trusted (partly checked, Kani: arena::kani_put_stats::put_stats_writes_empty; not checked: `final(perm).value().rank() == rank_arena_stats(index)`, the lock's ghost rank, which has no bytes for Kani to read; the `# Safety` contract, that `p` is the `stats` field of `init`'s storage: the harness passes a slot of its own)	contract 2008592952, body 2769252653
